<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Iasasa announces joint venture.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Iasasa announces joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican autoparts manufacturer Industria Automotriz SA (Iasasa) announced on Monday it had signed a letter of intent with U.S. firm Acurride Corp to produce wheels and rims in Mexico.</p>
<p>In a statement to the Mexican Stock Market, Iasasa said the new joint venture was due to be finalized during the first quarter of 1997 and aimed to supply markets in Mexico and South America.</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9562))</p>
